      "id": 1054013,
      "name": "[Ally] Bangvolver",
      "desc": "All squad members' <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color> increases by <color=#2BAD00>15%</color>.\nActive Skill: Use a random bullet for different moves:\nPowerful Firework Shell: Fires at the enemy with great force, dealing massive <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color> and accumulating a large amount of <color=#F0D12B>Physical Anomaly Buildup</color>.\nRegular Firework Shell: Fires at the enemy, dealing <color=#F0D12B>Physical DMG</color> and accumulating <color=#F0D12B>Physical Anomaly Buildup</color>.\nPaintball: Fails to fire as flowers leave the muzzle.",
